# Source: en.wiktionary.org, https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/munud.
# munud (masculine/feminine), plural munudau; soft m -> f after a
# trigger ("dau funud").
# Soft-mutated surfaces are listed beside the radical: Welsh changes a
# word's first letter after a preceding trigger.  Mutation table:
# en.wikipedia.org, "Welsh mutation".
# Singular only: the form a count of one takes.
munud
funud
